BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230622T102043Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nTai-chi\nSynopsis\n: \n"Tai Chi Yourself to Wellness 
	with Jeremy\nIf you think that Tai Chi is meant only for the elderly\, thi
	nk again! Tai Chi is a form of low impact exercise incorporates slow\, gen
	tle movements\, meditative state of mind and controlled breathing. It conf
	ers many benefits like improved balance\, core strength\, pain prevention 
	and relief\, and is proven to help manage chronic diseases. It is suitable
	 for people of all age groups and it’s never too early to start! Come le
	arn the 101s of Tai Chi from Master Jeremy – who is a passionate advocat
	e of the ancient martial art founded in 1670!"\nSpeakers\n:\nJeremy Hsiao 
	Chin SOO\nModerators\n:\nKenneth Yap\nJoining Instructions\n(In-Person)\n:
	\nDBS Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial Centre T
	ower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230721T155000
